# Applies to libEmuSC commit f503c9be3368370920055472599af9f2df78f623.
#
# This enables the single-part build used by RGSC55, adds the EMUSC_NO_REVERB
# and EMUSC_NO_CHORUS switches the unit builds with, and fixes incompatibilities
# with the drumlogue SDK's ARM C++ standard library/compiler and loader.
